Cheren: {VAR 0100 0000}!{VAR BE01}
I heard from Professor Juniper.
We can have a Pokémon?{VAR BE01}

...
...{VAR BE01}
What's keeping Bianca?{VAR BE01}

Cheren: Bianca...{VAR BE01}
I've known for ten years that you
have no sense of time, but...seriously...{VAR BE01}
Today's the day we can get a
Pokémon from Professor Juniper!{VAR BE01}

Bianca: So, where are the Pokémon?{VAR BE01}
They were delivered to {VAR 0100 0000}'s
house, so {VAR 0100 0000} gets first pick.{VAR BE01}

The Pokémon are waiting for us
inside that gift box.{VAR BE01}
OK, {VAR 0100 0000}, you go first and take
a peek at the gift box.{VAR BE01}
I want to meet the Pokémon right now!

Cheren: Hey, how come you get to pick
out my Pokémon?{VAR BE01}
Oh, never mind. I wanted {VAR 0101 0001}
from the start, anyway.{VAR BE01}

Bianca: Everyone has chosen a Pokémon!
...So that's that!{VAR BE01}
Hey, I know!
Let's have a Pokémon battle!{VAR BE01}

Cheren: Honestly, Bianca...{VAR BE01}
Even though they're still weak Pokémon,
you shouldn't have Pokémon battles{VAR BE00}
inside a house.{VAR BE01}

Bianca: Don't be a worrywart!
These little ones are weak, like you said.{VAR BE01}
We have to let them battle so they'll get
stronger. It's settled, {VAR 0100 0000}!{VAR BE00}
Get ready for a Pokémon battle!{VAR BE01}

Bianca: Wow...{VAR BE01}
{VAR 0100 0000}, you're gonna be
an awesome Trainer someday, I can tell!{VAR BE01}
No doubt!{VAR BE01}

Bianca: Wha...?{VAR BE01}
I got so absorbed in having my Pokémon
use moves, I won before even realizing...{VAR BE01}

Cheren: Uh...
...{VAR BE01}
Bianca, would you take a look around?{VAR BE01}

Wow! Pokémon are amaaaaazing!!
So little, but so strong!{VAR BE01}
I'm so glad that I get to have a Pokémon!{VAR BE01}
...Oh.
Um, sorry about your room, {VAR 0100 0000}.{VAR BE01}

Cheren: You...are completely hopeless.{VAR BE01}
Here!
I'll restore your Pokémon for you.{VAR BE01}

Cheren: It's amazing that you won
without your Pokémon's losing any{VAR BE00}
energy, which is called HP.{VAR BE01}
But you used some of the moves'
Power Points, or PP, though.{VAR BE01}

Bianca: Hey, Cheren!
How about you battle, too?{VAR BE01}
With all you know, I'm sure you can
battle without turning the room into{VAR BE00}
a disaster area like I did!{VAR BE01}

Cheren: I believe you're right!{VAR BE01}
It'll be no problem for me to keep
the room from getting any messier.{VAR BE01}
Besides, it's not fair if you two are the
only ones who get to have fun battling!{VAR BE01}

It's decided. You'll be my opponent...
in our first Pokémon battle!{VAR BE01}
Let's see what you can do, {VAR 0101 0001}!{VAR BE01}

Cheren: I made a strange blunder
in my first battle, but{VAR BE00}
this feeling I have...{VAR BE00}
...I'm finally a Trainer.{VAR BE01}
But first, we'd better go apologize to
your mother about this messed-up room.{VAR BE01}

Cheren: This feeling...
Finally, I'm a Trainer.{VAR BE01}
On top of that, we'd better go apologize
to your mother about this room.{VAR BE01}

It's a bed.{VAR BE01}
The sheets smell great because
Mom just washed them!

{VAR 0100 0000} checked the PC.{VAR BE01}
Pokémon Basics...{VAR BE01}
People live alongside Pokémon in
this world.{VAR BE01}
The people who battle with Pokémon
are called Pokémon Trainers.
